  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. It&rsquo;s given that function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 80 minus 6 x\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></math>. The value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 7 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced></math> can be found by substituting <math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in the given function, which yields <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 7 right parenthesis equals 80 minus 6 left parenthesis 7 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced></math>, or <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 7 right parenthesis equals 80 minus 42\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>42</mn></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 7 right parenthesis equals 38\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>38</mn></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 7 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"38\"><mn>38</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"80 minus 67\"><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>67</mn></math>, not <math alttext=\"80 minus 6 left parenthesis 7 right parenthesis\"><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"80 minus 6 left parenthesis 1 right parenthesis\"><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>, not <math alttext=\"80 minus 6 left parenthesis 7 right parenthesis\"><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"80 minus 6 plus 7\"><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math>, not <math alttext=\"80 minus 6 left parenthesis 7 right parenthesis\"><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced></math>.</p>",
